      "message": "docs(process): compress AGENTS.md, move procedures into skills\n\nAGENTS.md keeps the rules, in ASD-STE100, and goes from 1240 lines\n(81 kB) to about 700 lines (40 kB). The procedures that one task uses\nmove into five new skills: gate, runners, release-cut, fork-sync and\nissue-claims. A table at the top of AGENTS.md names the skill for each\ntask. The PR rules are now one section, \"Pull Request Law\".\n\nEach rule name that a skill, an agent or a code comment cites is still\na bold name or a heading. The dated quotations and the superseded notes\nare in the git history.\n\nFixes #1829\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
